{"titulo":"Sordland/Turn10/Personal_FinalSupper","id":213,"entradas":[{"id":0,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":1,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":2,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":3,"text":"With my impeachment trial looming and war on the horizon, I'd practically been sleeping in my office lately. But tonight, I made a deliberate effort to get home early.","menu":""},{"id":4,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":5,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":6,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":7,"text":"With the election looming, I'd practically been sleeping at the Maroon Palace lately. But tonight, I made a deliberate effort to get home early.","menu":""},{"id":8,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":9,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":10,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":11,"text":"Franc was coming to dinner for the first time in months.","menu":""},{"id":12,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":13,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":14,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":15,"text":"FC Anrica had an important match this evening. Despite everything that was going on, I didn't want to miss it.","menu":""},{"id":16,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":17,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":18,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":19,"text":"I'd invited Petr over for the occasion. It had been ages since we'd spent time together. And the house was feeling awfully empty these days.","menu":""},{"id":20,"text":"I'd invited Serge over for the occasion. The house was feeling awfully empty these days, and he was the closest thing I had left to a friend. Even if I was paying him.","menu":""},{"id":21,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":22,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":23,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":24,"text":"Even if the house was feeling awfully empty these days.","menu":""},{"id":25,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":26,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":27,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":28,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":29,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":30,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":31,"text":"I'd told Monica and Deana I wanted a family supper, just like in the old days. Monica had promised to cook something special.","menu":""},{"id":32,"text":"After much pleading on my part, Monica had given me rare permission to join her and Deana for supper. I couldn't be late.","menu":""},{"id":33,"text":"And Monica had given me rare permission to join the whole family for supper.","menu":""},{"id":34,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":35,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":36,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":37,"text":"I'd told everyone I wanted a family supper, just like in the old days. Monica had promised to cook something special.","menu":""},{"id":38,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":39,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":40,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":41,"text":"With the election looming and war on the horizon, I'd practically been sleeping in my office lately. But tonight, I made a deliberate effort to get home early.","menu":""},{"id":42,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":43,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":44,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":45,"text":"With my impeachment trial looming, I'd practically been sleeping at the Maroon Palace lately. But tonight, I made a deliberate effort to get home early.","menu":""},{"id":46,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":47,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":48,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":49,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":50,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":51,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":52,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":53,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":54,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":55,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":56,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":57,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":58,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":59,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":60,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":61,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":62,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":63,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":64,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":65,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":66,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":67,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":68,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":69,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":70,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":71,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":72,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":73,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":74,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":75,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":76,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":77,"text":"","menu":""},{"id":78,"t